1
00:01:40,300 --> 00:01:42,970
[Spring of The Blade]

2
00:01:43,530 --> 00:01:45,850
[Episode 4]

3
00:01:47,950 --> 00:01:51,100
-Please!
-That corrupt official brought no rice!

4
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:52,820
You corrupt official!

5
00:01:56,400 --> 00:01:57,660
Protect His Lordship!

6
00:01:59,039 --> 00:01:59,870
Catch him!

7
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,400
Let me go!

8
00:02:06,870 --> 00:02:08,800
I know you've suffered a lot.

9
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:12,120
I also know this world is unfair to you.

10
00:02:12,750 --> 00:02:13,840
Trust me.

11
00:02:15,280 --> 00:02:16,150
I will

12
00:02:17,430 --> 00:02:18,630
definitely help you.

13
00:02:32,520 --> 00:02:33,320
You're awake.

14
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:35,210
How am I still alive?

15
00:02:38,030 --> 00:02:38,960
His Lordship

16
00:02:39,190 --> 00:02:41,150
is the top interrogator
in the Criminal Justice Office.

17
00:02:41,150 --> 00:02:42,610
If he didn't want you dead,

18
00:02:43,079 --> 00:02:45,520
he wouldn't miss by half an inch.

19
00:02:46,120 --> 00:02:47,720
Now drink your chicken soup.

20
00:02:48,400 --> 00:02:50,430
It's made with premium ginseng
and silkie chicken.

21
00:02:50,430 --> 00:02:52,190
With just a few superficial wounds
like yours,

22
00:02:52,190 --> 00:02:54,250
2 or 3 months' rest and you'll be fine.

23
00:02:56,079 --> 00:02:57,210
I'm not drinking it.

24
00:02:57,680 --> 00:03:00,540
There are still many people
who have nothing to eat.

25
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:07,240
Before His Lordship came here,

26
00:03:07,240 --> 00:03:08,960
he swore an oath to His Majesty

27
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,430
that from this day forth,

28
00:03:10,430 --> 00:03:13,360
there will be no more
corrupt officials in Hengtang.

29
00:03:14,310 --> 00:03:15,370
Now that he's here,

30
00:03:15,710 --> 00:03:17,310
those who gave you stale rice

31
00:03:17,710 --> 00:03:19,310
and left you starving

32
00:03:19,750 --> 00:03:21,710
will surely pay

33
00:03:21,800 --> 00:03:23,130
for what they have done.

34
00:03:24,470 --> 00:03:25,190
So,

35
00:03:26,280 --> 00:03:27,560
just keep the money,

36
00:03:28,310 --> 00:03:29,510
focus on recovering,

37
00:03:29,870 --> 00:03:31,280
and wait for the news.

38
00:03:32,110 --> 00:03:34,120
Leave the rest to us.

39
00:03:37,710 --> 00:03:38,840
Now drink your soup.

40
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,870
I can do my part, too.

41
00:03:47,190 --> 00:03:49,650
[Zuixian Tavern]

42
00:03:57,030 --> 00:04:00,120
I've invited you all here today

43
00:04:00,560 --> 00:04:03,960
to ask for a favor, to be honest.

44
00:04:04,960 --> 00:04:07,120
Help me collect grain.

45
00:04:09,280 --> 00:04:11,800
At 3 times the market price.

46
00:04:13,080 --> 00:04:15,610
I hope I can count on your support,
gentlemen.

47
00:04:16,070 --> 00:04:16,720
Money

48
00:04:17,269 --> 00:04:18,950
will certainly not be an issue.

49
00:04:18,950 --> 00:04:21,750
This will allow me to
answer to the imperial court.

50
00:04:22,680 --> 00:04:24,040
I see.

51
00:04:24,270 --> 00:04:25,330
I'll be counting on

52
00:04:25,390 --> 00:04:28,240
your guidance in the days ahead, Lord Wei.

53
00:04:29,310 --> 00:04:30,040
Lord Yan,

54
00:04:30,310 --> 00:04:32,190
you're too kind.

55
00:04:32,310 --> 00:04:35,120
We're the ones who'll be counting on you.

56
00:04:35,510 --> 00:04:36,159
Right?

57
00:04:36,270 --> 00:04:37,730
-Yes, yes.
-That's right.

58
00:04:38,070 --> 00:04:38,720
Alright,

59
00:04:39,040 --> 00:04:40,120
enough shop talk.

60
00:04:40,830 --> 00:04:42,480
Let's begin.

61
00:05:07,310 --> 00:05:08,070
Come on.

62
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:10,560
To Lord Yan. To Lord Yan.

63
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,600
-Fire!
-Fire!

64
00:05:17,600 --> 00:05:19,070
-Put out the fire!
-Put out the fire!

65
00:05:19,070 --> 00:05:20,190
Fire!

66
00:05:20,390 --> 00:05:21,310
Put it out!

67
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:34,120
To Lord Yan. To Lord Yan.

68
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:34,680
Come on.

69
00:05:37,800 --> 00:05:38,430
Oh no!

70
00:05:38,720 --> 00:05:39,430
Help!

71
00:05:39,430 --> 00:05:40,430
Where's the fire?

72
00:05:40,800 --> 00:05:42,600
It seems to be the Xie Residence.

73
00:05:44,310 --> 00:05:45,560
Go help put out the fire!

74
00:05:45,560 --> 00:05:46,480
-Yes. Got it.
-Go. Hurry.

75
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,810
I'll take my leave then.

76
00:05:47,920 --> 00:05:48,680
Follow me!

77
00:05:48,870 --> 00:05:50,070
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

78
00:05:52,800 --> 00:05:53,560
Fan Zhong.

79
00:05:54,310 --> 00:05:55,040
Follow them.

80
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:55,800
Yes.

81
00:05:58,909 --> 00:06:01,490
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

82
00:06:00,190 --> 00:06:01,390
Lord Yan,

83
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:02,600
I've long heard of

84
00:06:02,750 --> 00:06:04,210
your remarkable bearing.

85
00:06:04,510 --> 00:06:05,720
Seeing you today,

86
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:08,090
I see the rumors were true.

87
00:06:09,600 --> 00:06:11,060
Old Madam, you flatter me.

88
00:06:11,870 --> 00:06:13,680
I came here today because

89
00:06:13,830 --> 00:06:16,230
I heard there was a fire
at your residence.

90
00:06:17,160 --> 00:06:18,120
I wanted to see

91
00:06:18,430 --> 00:06:19,480
if there was anything I could do

92
00:06:19,480 --> 00:06:21,240
to help.

93
00:06:24,720 --> 00:06:26,050
It was only a small fire.

94
00:06:26,310 --> 00:06:27,630
Hardly worth troubling you over,

95
00:06:27,630 --> 00:06:29,510
Lord Yan.

96
00:06:34,750 --> 00:06:35,390
By the way,

97
00:06:35,950 --> 00:06:37,950
I heard Lord Xie has taken ill,

98
00:06:38,390 --> 00:06:40,480
and His Majesty has allowed him
to return home to recuperate.

99
00:06:40,480 --> 00:06:42,010
I wonder when he'll arrive?

100
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:47,830
I'm afraid you'll be disappointed,
Lord Yan.

101
00:06:47,830 --> 00:06:48,720
Shu has

102
00:06:49,040 --> 00:06:50,510
an old injury in his back

103
00:06:51,190 --> 00:06:53,250
and cannot sit in a carriage for long,

104
00:06:53,560 --> 00:06:55,120
so he hired a boat

105
00:06:55,190 --> 00:06:56,250
to travel by water.

106
00:06:56,830 --> 00:06:58,040
This detour

107
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,000
will likely

108
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:02,070
take some time.

109
00:07:03,480 --> 00:07:05,120
That's truly a pity.

110
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:06,800
It seems

111
00:07:07,830 --> 00:07:10,290
I won't have the chance to meet him
after all.

112
00:07:12,360 --> 00:07:14,120
I see the fire did quite a bit of damage.

113
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,920
You must've suffered
some pretty heavy losses.

114
00:07:15,920 --> 00:07:17,040
So, Zhengjun,

115
00:07:17,800 --> 00:07:19,060
why don't you consider

116
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:21,670
selling your family's grain reserve to me?

117
00:07:22,070 --> 00:07:24,530
It might help make up for
some of your losses.

118
00:07:24,630 --> 00:07:25,490
Your Lordship,

119
00:07:25,680 --> 00:07:27,430
it's not that I'm unwilling to sell.

120
00:07:27,430 --> 00:07:29,490
We simply have no surplus grain left.

121
00:07:29,560 --> 00:07:31,000
Don't try to fool me.

122
00:07:32,390 --> 00:07:34,920
Just a few days ago, you had
30 boatloads of fresh grain.

123
00:07:34,920 --> 00:07:36,190
It's true—we transported the grain

124
00:07:36,190 --> 00:07:38,250
out of the city overnight yesterday.

125
00:07:38,510 --> 00:07:39,800
Those 30 boatloads

126
00:07:40,070 --> 00:07:42,000
have already passed Menghu Gorge.

127
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,770
What, you don't believe me?

128
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:47,750
Look,

129
00:07:48,310 --> 00:07:50,240
I even have the travel permit here.

130
00:07:53,720 --> 00:07:56,590
[Detailed Grain Shipment Record]

131
00:07:56,659 --> 00:07:57,460
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

132
00:07:59,360 --> 00:07:59,820
My Lord.

133
00:08:00,750 --> 00:08:01,920
Go check immediately

134
00:08:01,920 --> 00:08:03,430
to see whether the amount of grain
listed on the Xie family's travel permits

135
00:08:03,430 --> 00:08:06,070
matches the quantities
recorded in their ledgers.

136
00:08:06,070 --> 00:08:06,750
Yes.

137
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:09,190
My Lord, are you suggesting

138
00:08:09,190 --> 00:08:10,630
they might've been swapping the grain,

139
00:08:10,630 --> 00:08:11,920
using the Xie family's caravans

140
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:14,430
to smuggle relief grain out of Hengtang
in batches,

141
00:08:14,430 --> 00:08:16,230
sell it, then bring back
the same amount of stale rice

142
00:08:16,230 --> 00:08:17,800
to distribute to the refugees?

143
00:08:17,800 --> 00:08:19,060
That's what I suspect.

144
00:08:20,870 --> 00:08:23,190
Hengtang has suffered disasters
year after year,

145
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:25,830
yet the Xie family is constantly
shipping out dozens,

146
00:08:25,830 --> 00:08:27,960
even hundreds, of boatloads of grain.

147
00:08:28,830 --> 00:08:30,830
Where is all that grain coming from?

148
00:08:31,630 --> 00:08:34,030
And why have the court's relief officials

149
00:08:34,030 --> 00:08:35,909
repeatedly failed to make any headway?

150
00:08:35,909 --> 00:08:37,240
Something's not right.

151
00:08:40,789 --> 00:08:41,650
I have a feeling

152
00:08:42,510 --> 00:08:44,710
that the Xie family is the breakthrough

153
00:08:45,030 --> 00:08:46,870
we need in this embezzlement case.

154
00:08:46,870 --> 00:08:50,340
[Xie Residence of Hengtang]

155
00:09:05,790 --> 00:09:06,650
Your Lordship.

156
00:09:06,670 --> 00:09:09,200
You're personally adorning the Buddha
with auspicious markings.

157
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:11,150
Heaven will surely be moved
by your sincerity,

158
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:13,240
driving away evil spirits
and watching over us,

159
00:09:13,240 --> 00:09:15,080
keeping us safe and blessed.

160
00:09:15,080 --> 00:09:15,910
Yes, indeed.

161
00:09:18,080 --> 00:09:18,790
Lord Wei?

162
00:09:19,910 --> 00:09:20,770
Your Lordship?

163
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:23,260
Don't panic, you guys.

164
00:09:24,790 --> 00:09:25,650
Your Lordship.

165
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,250
Why don't we just

166
00:09:27,270 --> 00:09:28,130
trade our grain

167
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:29,260
with him for money?

168
00:09:29,630 --> 00:09:31,200
Trade?
How much are you planning to trade?

169
00:09:31,200 --> 00:09:32,200
Would any of the grain we have left

170
00:09:32,200 --> 00:09:33,260
survive scrutiny?

171
00:09:33,600 --> 00:09:35,600
What if Yan Rui turns on us
and denies everything?

172
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:37,360
We'd have far more to lose.

173
00:09:37,510 --> 00:09:38,120
Exactly.

174
00:09:38,480 --> 00:09:40,240
At a time like this, handing over grain

175
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,360
would be far too risky.

176
00:09:41,360 --> 00:09:42,910
We can't afford to take that gamble.

177
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:44,310
Yeah, we can't afford it.

178
00:09:46,480 --> 00:09:47,200
Lord Wei,

179
00:09:47,550 --> 00:09:48,720
what do you think?

180
00:09:50,600 --> 00:09:51,460
Your Lordship.

181
00:09:51,910 --> 00:09:54,040
Your Lordship, please say something!

182
00:09:58,240 --> 00:10:00,150
County Sheriff is absolutely right.

183
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:00,870
Yes.

184
00:10:06,630 --> 00:10:07,670
Yan Rui

185
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:11,550
is determined to investigate
the Xie family estate manager's case.

186
00:10:11,550 --> 00:10:13,210
If he's only after some grain,

187
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:15,480
that's no great concern.

188
00:10:17,200 --> 00:10:19,360
What worries me is that
he may have another motive,

189
00:10:19,360 --> 00:10:21,240
so we must not let our guard down.

190
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,810
But for now, gentlemen,

191
00:10:23,870 --> 00:10:25,120
stay calm.

192
00:10:26,360 --> 00:10:27,620
Go home and await word.

193
00:10:28,510 --> 00:10:30,320
-Well…
-Await word?

194
00:10:31,750 --> 00:10:33,550
Please, Buddha, bless us!

195
00:10:33,910 --> 00:10:35,510
Please let that demon Yan Rui

196
00:10:35,510 --> 00:10:38,170
get the hell out of Hengtang
as soon as possible!

197
00:10:44,440 --> 00:10:45,200
Ji San,

198
00:10:49,630 --> 00:10:50,750
go get Guo Baofeng.

199
00:11:02,270 --> 00:11:02,960
My Lord.

200
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:06,660
We've found the murderer of
the estate manager.

201
00:11:08,270 --> 00:11:10,480
But he'd already been silenced
by the time we found him.

202
00:11:10,480 --> 00:11:11,000
My Lord,

203
00:11:11,600 --> 00:11:12,730
we've hit a dead end.

204
00:11:39,030 --> 00:11:41,030
There's very little information
on this guy.

205
00:11:41,030 --> 00:11:42,870
We only found that
he'd gotten into trouble in the northwest.

206
00:11:42,870 --> 00:11:43,790
Nothing else.

207
00:11:55,550 --> 00:11:57,030
Those hands...

208
00:11:57,360 --> 00:11:59,000
He used to be a carpenter.

209
00:12:05,270 --> 00:12:05,870
Changyan.

210
00:12:06,720 --> 00:12:07,480
Come up and talk.

211
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:08,270
Alright.

212
00:12:12,720 --> 00:12:13,320
Changyan,

213
00:12:13,550 --> 00:12:14,320
you're really

214
00:12:14,320 --> 00:12:15,580
getting the hang of it.

215
00:12:16,200 --> 00:12:16,840
Baofeng.

216
00:12:17,630 --> 00:12:18,600
I heard

217
00:12:19,000 --> 00:12:21,330
it was you who killed that estate manager?

218
00:12:22,150 --> 00:12:22,600
Yes,

219
00:12:22,720 --> 00:12:23,450
I killed him.

220
00:12:26,790 --> 00:12:27,650
You killed him?

221
00:12:27,910 --> 00:12:28,360
Yes.

222
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:29,510
You're really something else.

223
00:12:29,510 --> 00:12:30,770
Nothing gets past you.

224
00:12:32,510 --> 00:12:33,640
Why did you kill him?

225
00:12:37,120 --> 00:12:38,650
Who ordered you to kill him?

226
00:12:39,320 --> 00:12:40,440
Who ordered you to kill him?

227
00:12:40,440 --> 00:12:41,630
Changyan! Changyan.

228
00:12:41,630 --> 00:12:42,230
Changyan.

229
00:12:42,360 --> 00:12:44,480
That wretched servant
worked at the Xie Estate

230
00:12:44,480 --> 00:12:46,200
and secretly kept a ledger
of our dealings.

231
00:12:46,200 --> 00:12:48,480
My men learned he was going to
report it to Yan Rui,

232
00:12:48,480 --> 00:12:49,240
so I had no choice

233
00:12:49,240 --> 00:12:50,390
but to strike first!

234
00:12:50,390 --> 00:12:51,390
You fool!

235
00:12:51,670 --> 00:12:53,080
Yan Rui is notorious.

236
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,390
Think about it—

237
00:12:54,670 --> 00:12:55,720
why would that estate manager

238
00:12:55,720 --> 00:12:57,440
choose him to expose the truth?

239
00:12:57,440 --> 00:12:58,630
Have you ever wondered why?

240
00:12:58,630 --> 00:13:01,030
You mean Yan Rui is hiding
something from us?

241
00:13:01,030 --> 00:13:01,840
Changyan! Changyan!

242
00:13:01,840 --> 00:13:02,840
I acted rashly.

243
00:13:03,360 --> 00:13:04,630
I was only worried

244
00:13:04,840 --> 00:13:05,720
that once the ledger was exposed,

245
00:13:05,720 --> 00:13:07,390
you'd be implicated, Changyan.

246
00:13:07,390 --> 00:13:08,480
Where's the ledger?

247
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:08,910
Changyan!

248
00:13:08,910 --> 00:13:10,150
The ledger fell into the river

249
00:13:10,150 --> 00:13:11,030
the night the estate manager died

250
00:13:11,030 --> 00:13:12,270
and was swept away by the current!

251
00:13:12,270 --> 00:13:13,730
No one knows where it went!

252
00:13:20,810 --> 00:13:22,910
[Respectfully Awaiting Your Presence
at the Shangsi Gathering]

253
00:13:22,930 --> 00:13:25,070
[Presented by the Founding Count's Family
to the Esteemed Xie Household]

254
00:13:23,550 --> 00:13:25,120
You could've simply

255
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:27,550
sent a servant to deliver the invitation.

256
00:13:27,550 --> 00:13:29,480
There was no need for you, Lady Prefect,

257
00:13:29,480 --> 00:13:30,720
to come in person.

258
00:13:32,390 --> 00:13:33,910
The invitation may be a small matter,

259
00:13:33,910 --> 00:13:35,200
but the banquet is not.

260
00:13:35,630 --> 00:13:37,360
[Lady Prefect]

261
00:13:35,840 --> 00:13:36,900
Well, you're aware

262
00:13:37,030 --> 00:13:40,080
why this Spring Banquet is being held.

263
00:13:41,480 --> 00:13:44,870
It concerns the selection of
the Founding Count family's Head Madam,

264
00:13:44,870 --> 00:13:46,730
so we must take every precaution.

265
00:13:47,000 --> 00:13:47,840
Indeed.

266
00:13:48,080 --> 00:13:49,630
We'll just have to see

267
00:13:49,750 --> 00:13:51,270
which young lady

268
00:13:51,550 --> 00:13:53,480
can win Her Ladyship's favor then.

269
00:13:55,150 --> 00:13:55,750
By the way,

270
00:13:56,000 --> 00:13:59,200
are the introductory gifts
for the Spring Banquet ready?

271
00:14:24,200 --> 00:14:26,320
Which young lady made this?

272
00:14:26,630 --> 00:14:28,200
It's exquisite.

273
00:14:32,200 --> 00:14:34,600
These Go stones are beautifully polished.

274
00:14:35,240 --> 00:14:36,480
Founding Countess

275
00:14:36,670 --> 00:14:37,910
adores playing Go,

276
00:14:38,240 --> 00:14:39,030
so this gift

277
00:14:39,480 --> 00:14:41,550
is sure to please her.

278
00:14:44,480 --> 00:14:46,790
Eldest Lady made this
in her spare time.

279
00:14:53,480 --> 00:14:54,320
And look,

280
00:14:54,630 --> 00:14:57,000
Qingrong's embroidery,
"Spring's Unparalleled Beauty",

281
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,550
is quite elegant too.

282
00:15:00,360 --> 00:15:02,870
Why don't I see Fourth Lady's gift?

283
00:15:04,360 --> 00:15:07,020
Qingyuan went out to run an errand
for Old Madam.

284
00:15:07,600 --> 00:15:09,200
She only recently returned to the family

285
00:15:09,200 --> 00:15:11,080
and still has much to learn,

286
00:15:11,480 --> 00:15:12,670
so she didn't have time

287
00:15:12,670 --> 00:15:13,960
to prepare a gift.

288
00:15:14,270 --> 00:15:15,240
Please forgive

289
00:15:15,440 --> 00:15:16,570
our lack of manners.

290
00:15:17,150 --> 00:15:18,910
They're all fine young ladies,

291
00:15:19,390 --> 00:15:21,120
and the gifts are all lovely.

292
00:15:21,440 --> 00:15:23,200
Even if Fourth Lady is busy,

293
00:15:23,630 --> 00:15:24,750
it's the thought

294
00:15:24,910 --> 00:15:25,960
that counts.

295
00:15:26,910 --> 00:15:27,630
Of course.

296
00:15:28,630 --> 00:15:29,690
Please take a seat.

297
00:15:32,910 --> 00:15:33,630
Put it down!

298
00:15:33,750 --> 00:15:34,550
Shut up!

299
00:15:35,550 --> 00:15:37,150
A born wretch like you

300
00:15:37,390 --> 00:15:39,320
thinks you're fit to use Go stones?

301
00:15:39,670 --> 00:15:41,200
I'd say the mud at the bottom of the pond

302
00:15:41,200 --> 00:15:42,600
suits you better.

303
00:15:45,750 --> 00:15:47,060
I polished them myself!

304
00:15:47,060 --> 00:15:48,670
So what if you polished them yourself?

305
00:15:48,670 --> 00:15:50,150
Who do you think you are?

306
00:15:50,630 --> 00:15:51,490
Second Sister,

307
00:15:51,750 --> 00:15:52,540
please.

308
00:15:52,570 --> 00:15:53,960
I won't fight you over anything.

309
00:15:53,960 --> 00:15:54,840
Everything's yours.

310
00:15:54,840 --> 00:15:55,720
I'm begging you.

311
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:56,440
Stop throwing them!

312
00:15:56,440 --> 00:15:57,390
I'm begging you!

313
00:15:57,430 --> 00:15:59,090
You're just like your mother—

314
00:15:59,440 --> 00:16:01,100
both utterly beneath notice.

315
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,730
Second Sister.

316
00:16:05,720 --> 00:16:08,320
Is this a copy of Zhao Chang's painting?

317
00:16:11,720 --> 00:16:13,050
It's beautifully done.

318
00:16:13,150 --> 00:16:14,390
Put it down.

319
00:16:16,870 --> 00:16:17,360
Yes.

320
00:16:19,870 --> 00:16:20,360
You...

321
00:16:21,360 --> 00:16:22,290
My hand slipped.

322
00:16:23,120 --> 00:16:24,120
Don't listen to her nonsense.

323
00:16:24,120 --> 00:16:24,910
She only knows how to play innocent.

324
00:16:24,910 --> 00:16:27,120
-How dare you...
-Second Sister. Third Sister.

325
00:16:27,120 --> 00:16:29,720
You both know how to protect
your own hard work,

326
00:16:29,870 --> 00:16:31,270
so why treat Eldest Sister's

327
00:16:31,270 --> 00:16:32,870
hard work

328
00:16:33,030 --> 00:16:34,120
as worthless?

329
00:16:34,510 --> 00:16:35,600
You little wretch.

330
00:16:36,030 --> 00:16:37,720
How dare you lecture me?

331
00:16:38,360 --> 00:16:39,020
Let go of me!

332
00:16:39,120 --> 00:16:39,790
Let go of me!

333
00:16:41,240 --> 00:16:41,750
Let go!

334
00:16:42,150 --> 00:16:43,000
What are you waiting for?

335
00:16:43,000 --> 00:16:43,790
Get her!

336
00:16:44,750 --> 00:16:46,950
-Throw her into the water!
-Let go of me!

337
00:16:47,480 --> 00:16:48,600
-Let go of me!
-Second Sister!

338
00:16:48,600 --> 00:16:50,000
This has nothing to do with Fourth Sister!

339
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:51,080
Let her go!

340
00:16:51,080 --> 00:16:51,720
Let me go!

341
00:16:51,720 --> 00:16:52,480
Let go!

342
00:16:53,750 --> 00:16:55,320
Today, I'll show you

343
00:16:55,320 --> 00:16:56,670
who rules this Xie household!

344
00:16:56,670 --> 00:16:57,480
Push her in!

345
00:16:58,240 --> 00:16:59,030
Stop!

346
00:16:59,840 --> 00:17:00,900
What are you doing?

347
00:17:13,030 --> 00:17:14,240
Put it down.

348
00:17:16,310 --> 00:17:16,790
Yes.

349
00:17:18,109 --> 00:17:18,720
You...

350
00:17:37,920 --> 00:17:40,750
This is perilla candy
Granny taught me to make.

351
00:17:41,160 --> 00:17:42,820
Please accept them, Lord Yan.

352
00:17:46,400 --> 00:17:47,070
My Lord.

353
00:17:48,070 --> 00:17:49,720
My Lord, are you taking medicine?

354
00:17:49,720 --> 00:17:50,480
Are you sick?

355
00:17:50,640 --> 00:17:51,440
I'll go get a doctor.

356
00:17:51,440 --> 00:17:51,960
No need.

357
00:17:52,590 --> 00:17:53,880
Any leads?

358
00:17:54,270 --> 00:17:56,480
I found a flower token on the murderer

359
00:17:56,480 --> 00:17:57,590
and traced it back.

360
00:17:57,880 --> 00:17:58,960
Only Zuixian Tavern

361
00:17:58,960 --> 00:18:01,070
uses this kind of premium flower paper,

362
00:18:01,070 --> 00:18:01,880
with a delicate

363
00:18:01,880 --> 00:18:03,880
little wine jug painted on the back.

364
00:18:04,440 --> 00:18:06,790
One token is given
for every 50 taels spent.

365
00:18:06,790 --> 00:18:08,270
Every official
at the Hengtang county government

366
00:18:08,270 --> 00:18:09,480
has one on their desk.

367
00:18:09,640 --> 00:18:12,240
And Second Young Master Xie
is a regular there.

368
00:18:15,440 --> 00:18:16,640
The Xie family again.

369
00:18:17,440 --> 00:18:18,550
My Lord, are you waiting for

370
00:18:18,550 --> 00:18:20,210
Xie Shu to return to Hengtang?

371
00:18:20,750 --> 00:18:22,400
What if he doesn't come back anytime soon?

372
00:18:22,400 --> 00:18:23,440
What do we do then?

373
00:18:26,160 --> 00:18:27,450
Wine, women, wealth, and power.

374
00:18:27,450 --> 00:18:29,290
There's plenty I can do.

375
00:18:29,400 --> 00:18:32,070
Isn't the Spring Banquet
for the Shangsi Festival coming up?

376
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:33,590
Let's just wait a little longer.

377
00:18:33,590 --> 00:18:34,680
W... Wait?

378
00:18:35,440 --> 00:18:36,900
Wait until this rain falls

379
00:18:37,550 --> 00:18:39,680
and the waters of Hengtang turn murky.

380
00:18:39,960 --> 00:18:41,490
Once the waters turn murky,

381
00:18:41,920 --> 00:18:43,510
we can start fishing.

382
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:52,860
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

383
00:18:47,790 --> 00:18:49,000
It was all my fault.

384
00:18:49,790 --> 00:18:52,250
I shouldn't have argued
with Second Sister.

385
00:18:55,590 --> 00:18:56,680
Just now,

386
00:18:57,790 --> 00:18:59,960
you took all the blame upon yourself...

387
00:18:59,960 --> 00:19:00,790
I'm fine.

388
00:19:01,480 --> 00:19:03,010
You needn't worry about me.

389
00:19:03,550 --> 00:19:06,030
When you go back, remember to
comfort Third Madam.

390
00:19:06,030 --> 00:19:07,160
Don't let her worry.

391
00:19:09,550 --> 00:19:11,150
But in these inner quarters,

392
00:19:11,640 --> 00:19:14,880
the truth is often
the least important thing.

393
00:19:16,680 --> 00:19:17,920
I only hope

394
00:19:18,480 --> 00:19:20,480
I can live peacefully with my mother

395
00:19:20,830 --> 00:19:22,510
here at Hanxiang Parlor.

396
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:24,030
Is that so?

397
00:19:26,270 --> 00:19:28,270
My mother used to think the same way.

398
00:19:29,070 --> 00:19:30,270
But you've all seen

399
00:19:31,070 --> 00:19:32,350
how it ended for her.

400
00:19:35,070 --> 00:19:36,800
Second Sister and Third Sister

401
00:19:36,920 --> 00:19:39,320
can afford to be so spoiled
and overbearing

402
00:19:40,030 --> 00:19:42,350
because they have Head Madam's protection.

403
00:19:42,350 --> 00:19:43,410
But what about you?

404
00:19:44,440 --> 00:19:46,640
When your mother was wrongfully accused,

405
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:48,370
there was nothing you could do.

406
00:19:50,920 --> 00:19:53,070
Because you simply didn't stand
high enough.

407
00:19:53,070 --> 00:19:54,530
Even if you keep yielding,

408
00:19:54,720 --> 00:19:55,650
again and again,

409
00:19:56,070 --> 00:19:57,130
you and your mother

410
00:19:57,680 --> 00:19:59,030
will still be bullied

411
00:19:59,440 --> 00:20:00,510
and humiliated.

412
00:20:03,830 --> 00:20:04,690
Eldest Sister.

413
00:20:05,400 --> 00:20:06,400
Are you truly

414
00:20:07,240 --> 00:20:09,400
willing to be a discarded pawn?

415
00:20:20,550 --> 00:20:21,810
You still have a choice

416
00:20:23,110 --> 00:20:24,480
in which path you take.

417
00:20:54,600 --> 00:20:59,260
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

418
00:21:07,350 --> 00:21:08,110
Lord Yan.

419
00:21:08,830 --> 00:21:12,000
Are you going to keep investigating
the estate manager's case?

420
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:13,680
I need to notify the government

421
00:21:13,680 --> 00:21:15,810
and make the necessary arrangements.

422
00:21:21,590 --> 00:21:22,590
You may leave us.

423
00:21:34,590 --> 00:21:36,200
I couldn't care less

424
00:21:36,270 --> 00:21:37,870
how the estate manager died.

425
00:21:37,960 --> 00:21:39,110
What I care about

426
00:21:39,640 --> 00:21:42,350
is the grain he had that's now missing.

427
00:21:44,790 --> 00:21:45,850
You mean the grain?

428
00:21:46,350 --> 00:21:47,240
Exactly.

429
00:21:47,440 --> 00:21:50,000
The relief grain we've received
is nowhere near enough.

430
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,680
If you gentlemen

431
00:21:51,790 --> 00:21:53,160
weren't hoarding your grain so tightly

432
00:21:53,160 --> 00:21:54,720
and refusing to sell it to me,

433
00:21:54,720 --> 00:21:55,380
I wouldn't have to keep

434
00:21:55,380 --> 00:21:58,240
squeezing grain out of the Xie family
day after day.

435
00:22:01,200 --> 00:22:02,590
Luckily, I've come into

436
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:04,480
a little extra money today.

437
00:22:05,030 --> 00:22:06,880
If you gentlemen trust me,

438
00:22:06,880 --> 00:22:08,880
I'm willing to double the price

439
00:22:09,590 --> 00:22:10,650
I pay for the grain.

440
00:22:11,110 --> 00:22:12,310
All I ask

441
00:22:12,550 --> 00:22:15,210
is that you help me out of
this urgent situation.

442
00:22:24,750 --> 00:22:25,720
Nice wine.

443
00:22:27,160 --> 00:22:29,680
Since you're being so generous, Lord Yan,

444
00:22:30,350 --> 00:22:31,070
we can

445
00:22:31,590 --> 00:22:33,440
hardly refuse.

446
00:22:34,750 --> 00:22:35,440
Gentlemen,

447
00:22:36,720 --> 00:22:39,320
if you'd like to trade your grain
with Lord Yan,

448
00:22:39,550 --> 00:22:40,950
please feel free to do so.

449
00:22:42,200 --> 00:22:43,310
Great. Excellent.

450
00:22:54,350 --> 00:22:55,590
In that case...

451
00:22:55,640 --> 00:22:56,720
Sheriff He.

452
00:22:56,960 --> 00:22:57,820
Your Lordship.

453
00:22:58,000 --> 00:22:59,440
Just find some excuse

454
00:22:59,480 --> 00:23:02,210
and close the case of
the estate manager's death.

455
00:23:02,270 --> 00:23:04,440
We can't let the Xie family's money

456
00:23:04,440 --> 00:23:05,110
go to waste,

457
00:23:05,110 --> 00:23:05,880
can we?

458
00:23:07,110 --> 00:23:08,000
I understand.

459
00:23:08,750 --> 00:23:09,310
Come on,

460
00:23:09,720 --> 00:23:10,780
a toast to Lord Yan.

461
00:23:10,830 --> 00:23:11,400
Come on.

462
00:23:12,510 --> 00:23:13,970
-To Lord Yan.
-To Lord Yan.

463
00:23:22,080 --> 00:23:24,500
[Wuzhu Courtyard]

464
00:23:22,440 --> 00:23:23,970
Qingru may be thoughtless,

465
00:23:24,920 --> 00:23:26,450
but you should know better!

466
00:23:26,720 --> 00:23:28,550
With such a distinguished guest present,

467
00:23:28,550 --> 00:23:30,480
how could you be so lacking in tact?

468
00:23:31,590 --> 00:23:32,850
You're right, Mother.

469
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:34,750
I was wrong.

470
00:23:35,350 --> 00:23:36,400
But it was

471
00:23:36,720 --> 00:23:38,650
that wretched girl who started it.

472
00:23:38,790 --> 00:23:40,330
She was the one
who tore Second Sister's painting first.

473
00:23:40,330 --> 00:23:43,130
Even so, it was not your place
to teach her a lesson.

474
00:23:47,480 --> 00:23:48,200
Madam.

475
00:23:48,510 --> 00:23:51,750
Qingyuan took all the blame upon herself

476
00:23:52,030 --> 00:23:54,270
and begged Old Madam to release Qinghe.

477
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,240
Old Madam agreed,

478
00:23:56,350 --> 00:24:00,480
but she was furious that she had been
embarrassed in front of Lady Prefect.

479
00:24:00,830 --> 00:24:01,790
Madam,

480
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:04,550
you know what Second Madam is like.

481
00:24:04,960 --> 00:24:06,420
She's taking this opportunity

482
00:24:06,420 --> 00:24:08,690
to have Nanny Rong handle this matter.

483
00:24:08,920 --> 00:24:10,590
With all these old and new grievances,

484
00:24:10,590 --> 00:24:12,390
there's bound to be a commotion.

485
00:24:12,400 --> 00:24:15,030
Let's just sit back and enjoy the show.

486
00:24:18,270 --> 00:24:19,330
How dare you smile?

487
00:24:19,960 --> 00:24:21,620
Old Madam may have spared you,

488
00:24:21,680 --> 00:24:22,940
but I certainly won't.

489
00:24:23,680 --> 00:24:25,960
Go and copy the Heart Sutra 100 times.

490
00:24:27,550 --> 00:24:28,310
Got it.

491
00:24:31,830 --> 00:24:33,400
I took all the blame

492
00:24:33,920 --> 00:24:36,450
so Old Madam would feel
even more sorry for me—

493
00:24:37,030 --> 00:24:39,230
and so that those with ulterior motives

494
00:24:39,920 --> 00:24:41,850
would willingly walk into my trap.

495
00:24:42,110 --> 00:24:46,890
[A Legacy of Virtue for Eternity]

496
00:24:47,550 --> 00:24:48,590
Fourth Lady.

497
00:24:48,750 --> 00:24:50,410
Please come to the front hall.

498
00:24:57,400 --> 00:25:00,030
Everyone's waiting.

499
00:25:01,400 --> 00:25:02,270
Very well.

500
00:25:03,070 --> 00:25:06,270
It may seem as if I've fallen into
the hands of a wicked servant like you,

501
00:25:06,270 --> 00:25:09,600
but this is also my chance
to turn your own blade against you.

502
00:25:26,270 --> 00:25:28,640
Fourth Lady, please.

503
00:25:32,490 --> 00:25:35,600
[Jingmu Hall]

504
00:25:45,000 --> 00:25:46,720
Old Madam punished me by making me kneel
in the ancestral hall,

505
00:25:46,720 --> 00:25:48,480
but she never said I'd be flogged.

506
00:25:48,480 --> 00:25:51,280
Are you taking advantage
of the situation, Nanny?

507
00:25:53,920 --> 00:25:55,720
How could you say that, Fourth Lady?

508
00:25:55,720 --> 00:25:58,750
I'd never dare to abuse my position
to settle a personal grudge.

509
00:25:58,750 --> 00:26:00,680
According to the Xie family rules,

510
00:26:01,240 --> 00:26:03,350
for disobeying your elder sister
and offending a distinguished guest,

511
00:26:03,350 --> 00:26:04,830
you deserve 10 lashes.

512
00:26:05,400 --> 00:26:06,640
Old Madam

513
00:26:06,680 --> 00:26:07,640
simply forgot.

514
00:26:08,440 --> 00:26:10,790
So as the governess,

515
00:26:11,480 --> 00:26:13,680
I'm merely helping to enforce the rule.

516
00:26:25,640 --> 00:26:27,170
Do the family rules specify

517
00:26:27,440 --> 00:26:29,770
that the cane must be
dipped in salt water?

518
00:26:31,590 --> 00:26:33,440
You're indeed smart, Fourth Lady.

519
00:26:33,440 --> 00:26:35,240
You even know this is salt water.

520
00:26:35,960 --> 00:26:39,000
The rules only say 10 lashes—

521
00:26:39,590 --> 00:26:42,480
they never specify
what kind of whip to use.

522
00:26:43,350 --> 00:26:44,110
Fine.

523
00:26:44,550 --> 00:26:45,950
Since it's a family rule,

524
00:26:46,200 --> 00:26:48,000
then you may carry it out, Nanny.

525
00:26:49,350 --> 00:26:51,200
But let me remind you:

526
00:26:52,160 --> 00:26:54,690
however many lashes
you strike me with today,

527
00:26:54,790 --> 00:26:55,640
I will

528
00:26:55,830 --> 00:26:57,680
return them in full one day.

529
00:27:00,350 --> 00:27:01,550
Fourth Lady,

530
00:27:01,720 --> 00:27:03,310
that's quite a bold claim.

531
00:27:03,570 --> 00:27:09,370
[Jingmu Hall]

532
00:27:04,070 --> 00:27:05,270
Did you all hear that?

533
00:27:08,240 --> 00:27:09,370
Look who's talking.

534
00:27:09,960 --> 00:27:11,750
First survive

535
00:27:12,160 --> 00:27:13,090
these 10 lashes,

536
00:27:13,510 --> 00:27:14,370
then we'll see.

537
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,280
Take her away!

538
00:27:19,220 --> 00:27:20,770
[Jingmu Hall]

539
00:27:26,550 --> 00:27:28,070
Xie Qingyuan,

540
00:27:28,350 --> 00:27:29,790
look at you now!

541
00:27:32,240 --> 00:27:32,920
Back off.

542
00:27:49,350 --> 00:27:50,680
Maybe we should call it a day.

543
00:27:50,680 --> 00:27:52,310
Keep this up and you'll kill her.

544
00:27:52,310 --> 00:27:54,240
Since when do you get to lecture me?

545
00:28:17,960 --> 00:28:19,000
Xie Qingyuan.

546
00:28:19,110 --> 00:28:21,640
You've got quite a stiff backbone,
don't you?

547
00:28:22,030 --> 00:28:23,550
Much tougher than your mother was

548
00:28:23,550 --> 00:28:24,960
back then.

549
00:28:25,000 --> 00:28:28,610
[Jingmu Hall]

550
00:28:32,110 --> 00:28:35,160
Why don't you follow your mother's example
and bow your head in apology?

551
00:28:35,160 --> 00:28:37,790
Then I might let you off the hook.

552
00:28:47,550 --> 00:28:48,750
Very well, very well.

553
00:28:50,000 --> 00:28:53,750
Since you refuse to take the easy way out,

554
00:28:54,400 --> 00:28:55,660
I'll teach you a lesson

555
00:28:56,920 --> 00:28:58,480
the hard way!

556
00:29:01,280 --> 00:29:01,800
[Jingmu Hall]

557
00:29:14,350 --> 00:29:15,680
Lord Yan.

558
00:29:19,200 --> 00:29:20,640
I had no idea

559
00:29:21,070 --> 00:29:22,730
the rules of the Xie household

560
00:29:23,550 --> 00:29:25,030
were set by a mere servant.

561
00:29:26,790 --> 00:29:28,000
Lord Yan,

562
00:29:29,000 --> 00:29:30,800
this is a private family matter—

563
00:29:43,030 --> 00:29:44,440
Lord Yan, you…

564
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:53,580
Since you're so fond of rules,

565
00:29:53,880 --> 00:29:56,440
I'll let you experience your own rules
firsthand.

566
00:29:56,440 --> 00:29:57,270
Fan Zhong.

567
00:29:58,240 --> 00:29:59,070
No, no, no...

568
00:29:59,830 --> 00:30:00,510
Lord Yan.

569
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:01,640
Lord Fan.

570
00:30:01,920 --> 00:30:03,650
I was simply following orders.

571
00:30:09,350 --> 00:30:13,640
-I can't possibly stand your whipping...
-You're so skilled at interrogation.

572
00:30:13,640 --> 00:30:15,790
It's a waste of your talent
to stay with the Xie family.

573
00:30:15,790 --> 00:30:17,350
Why don't you come work for
the Criminal Justice Office instead?

574
00:30:17,350 --> 00:30:19,480
You can have a proper discussion

575
00:30:20,030 --> 00:30:21,830
with my subordinate, Fan Zhong.

576
00:30:23,830 --> 00:30:24,790
Yan Rui!

577
00:30:25,720 --> 00:30:27,780
You're being utterly presumptuous!

578
00:30:32,030 --> 00:30:32,750
Keep beating her!

579
00:30:32,750 --> 00:30:33,750
Old Madam!

580
00:30:34,000 --> 00:30:35,160
Save me!

581
00:30:40,070 --> 00:30:41,790
What on earth is going on?

582
00:30:42,070 --> 00:30:42,960
Lord Yan.

583
00:30:43,350 --> 00:30:46,010
Our Xie family is a prestigious clan,
after all.

584
00:30:46,030 --> 00:30:47,240
Do you truly intend to

585
00:30:47,270 --> 00:30:49,750
show such disrespect to our patriarch?

586
00:30:50,960 --> 00:30:51,920
Your patriarch?

587
00:30:53,750 --> 00:30:55,640
I answer only to His Majesty.

588
00:30:56,270 --> 00:30:57,880
Even a feudal prince

589
00:30:58,310 --> 00:31:00,070
has no hold over me.

590
00:31:01,000 --> 00:31:03,550
If you think invoking Xie Shu
will intimidate me,

591
00:31:03,550 --> 00:31:05,110
perhaps you've grown senile.

592
00:31:05,110 --> 00:31:05,590
You...

593
00:31:05,590 --> 00:31:06,310
Fan Zhong.

594
00:31:06,750 --> 00:31:07,750
Keep her alive

595
00:31:08,030 --> 00:31:09,430
and take good care of her.

596
00:31:09,510 --> 00:31:10,110
Yes!

597
00:31:11,240 --> 00:31:12,720
Save me, Second Madam!

598
00:31:13,440 --> 00:31:14,270
What a joke!

599
00:31:14,680 --> 00:31:17,410
I'd like to see who dares
step out that gate today!

600
00:31:17,480 --> 00:31:20,240
Do you truly think
you can bully our Xie family

601
00:31:20,240 --> 00:31:22,240
just because there's no one here
to stand up for us?

602
00:31:22,240 --> 00:31:23,770
How formidable, Old Madam.

603
00:31:24,960 --> 00:31:26,550
Looks like you've been
letting these lackeys

604
00:31:26,550 --> 00:31:29,750
throw their weight around in your name
for quite some time.

605
00:31:29,750 --> 00:31:32,550
No wonder they've all grown
so full of themselves.

606
00:31:32,550 --> 00:31:34,750
I happen to have some free time tonight,

607
00:31:35,110 --> 00:31:37,570
so I'm kindly teaching them a lesson
for you.

608
00:31:41,830 --> 00:31:43,830
Aren't you worried
I'll file an imperial petition

609
00:31:43,830 --> 00:31:46,360
-and bring you before His Majesty?
-Go ahead.

610
00:31:46,880 --> 00:31:48,640
But you'll have to take a number.

611
00:31:48,640 --> 00:31:52,030
There must be hundreds of petitions
filed against me before His Majesty.

612
00:31:52,030 --> 00:31:53,890
One more won't make a difference.

613
00:31:53,920 --> 00:31:55,310
It's just Lord Xie's been

614
00:31:55,310 --> 00:31:58,970
working diligently to build his career
in the Northern Frontier,

615
00:31:59,000 --> 00:32:01,750
only to have his reputation ruined

616
00:32:02,000 --> 00:32:03,590
by these ignorant women at home.

617
00:32:03,590 --> 00:32:04,750
What a shame.

618
00:32:06,590 --> 00:32:07,200
You...

619
00:32:07,510 --> 00:32:08,110
You...

620
00:32:08,510 --> 00:32:09,110
You...

621
00:32:09,350 --> 00:32:10,310
Xie Qingyuan

622
00:32:10,750 --> 00:32:13,400
is a key witness in a case
under my authority.

623
00:32:14,000 --> 00:32:16,260
I'm taking her into protective custody.

624
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:18,240
Any objections?

625
00:32:21,350 --> 00:32:22,440
Even if there is,

626
00:32:23,350 --> 00:32:24,550
I couldn't care less.

627
00:33:00,960 --> 00:33:03,090
Thank you for saving my life, Lord Yan.

628
00:33:03,880 --> 00:33:05,030
But it's so late.

629
00:33:06,110 --> 00:33:08,240
What brought you to the Xie Residence?

630
00:33:14,070 --> 00:33:16,270
If you hadn't gone to such great lengths

631
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,350
to make those poisoned candies for me—

632
00:33:18,350 --> 00:33:20,640
causing my heart to race uncontrollably,
my inner energy to stagnate,

633
00:33:20,640 --> 00:33:22,160
and even making me cough up blood—

634
00:33:22,160 --> 00:33:23,720
how could I have been so rude

635
00:33:23,720 --> 00:33:26,110
as to go to the Xie Residence
to look for you, lady?

636
00:33:26,110 --> 00:33:26,830
Poison?

637
00:33:30,880 --> 00:33:32,740
Your Lordship, give me your hand.

638
00:33:49,200 --> 00:33:51,200
Your Lordship,
I'm afraid you've misunderstood.

639
00:33:51,200 --> 00:33:52,590
Did you perhaps

640
00:33:53,030 --> 00:33:55,720
channel your energy
or practice martial arts

641
00:33:55,960 --> 00:33:57,760
after eating the perilla candy?

642
00:33:59,160 --> 00:34:02,690
It's my fault for not explaining this
clearly to Your Lordship.

643
00:34:02,880 --> 00:34:07,240
This perilla candy is meant to
refresh the mind and sharpen the senses,

644
00:34:07,270 --> 00:34:10,400
so it contains not only mint and ice leaf,

645
00:34:10,880 --> 00:34:12,280
but also a small amount of

646
00:34:13,110 --> 00:34:14,110
toad venom

647
00:34:14,360 --> 00:34:16,480
to invigorate blood circulation
and dispel blood stasis.

648
00:34:16,480 --> 00:34:17,710
Both ingredients

649
00:34:18,150 --> 00:34:19,630
are extremely potent.

650
00:34:20,030 --> 00:34:21,320
Within 8 hours

651
00:34:21,630 --> 00:34:23,159
after taking the medicine,

652
00:34:23,480 --> 00:34:24,920
you must not practice martial arts

653
00:34:24,920 --> 00:34:26,250
or channel your energy.

654
00:34:27,440 --> 00:34:28,630
Ordinary people

655
00:34:29,230 --> 00:34:31,070
won't have any problems after eating it.

656
00:34:31,070 --> 00:34:33,130
If Your Lordship doesn't believe me,

657
00:34:33,760 --> 00:34:35,159
you can test it yourself.

658
00:35:14,480 --> 00:35:15,480
Now you

659
00:35:16,840 --> 00:35:17,900
believe me, right?

660
00:35:19,000 --> 00:35:21,670
It is my fault

661
00:35:22,070 --> 00:35:24,470
that Your Lordship
had to suffer like that.

662
00:35:26,190 --> 00:35:28,390
But you accused me of trying to harm you—

663
00:35:28,480 --> 00:35:29,840
how could I have known

664
00:35:30,230 --> 00:35:31,830
when you'd take the medicine

665
00:35:32,000 --> 00:35:33,800
or practice martial arts?

666
00:35:40,110 --> 00:35:41,370
Since that's the case,

667
00:35:42,230 --> 00:35:45,070
may I get off the carriage?

668
00:35:53,960 --> 00:35:55,360
Xie Qingyuan.

669
00:35:55,840 --> 00:35:58,510
You certainly have some nerve.

670
00:36:00,190 --> 00:36:02,000
Of all the things you could have done,

671
00:36:02,000 --> 00:36:04,190
you chose to try your tricks on me.

672
00:36:09,670 --> 00:36:11,550
I don't care why you're so determined

673
00:36:11,550 --> 00:36:12,950
to stay in the Xie family,

674
00:36:13,710 --> 00:36:14,770
but remember this:

675
00:36:15,920 --> 00:36:18,440
if you ever provoke me again,
I'll formally

676
00:36:19,030 --> 00:36:22,360
send a proposal to the Xie family
to take you as my concubine,

677
00:36:22,960 --> 00:36:25,030
then lock you away in the Yan Residence

678
00:36:25,030 --> 00:36:26,670
and make sure you never set foot

679
00:36:26,670 --> 00:36:28,200
in the Xie Residence again.

680
00:36:32,070 --> 00:36:33,070
Let me get off.

681
00:36:39,030 --> 00:36:40,360
Old Madam!

682
00:36:41,360 --> 00:36:43,590
You must stand up for me!

683
00:36:43,840 --> 00:36:46,710
Even when you beat a dog,
you have to consider its owner, right?

684
00:36:46,710 --> 00:36:48,670
Look what Lord Yan

685
00:36:49,230 --> 00:36:50,110
did to me

686
00:36:50,110 --> 00:36:53,000
just for the sake of Fourth Lady!

687
00:36:53,630 --> 00:36:56,550
If you'd arrived a bit later,

688
00:36:56,880 --> 00:37:00,480
I'd never have been able to
serve you again...

689
00:37:03,230 --> 00:37:04,030
Old Madam,

690
00:37:04,440 --> 00:37:05,590
just look at her.

691
00:37:06,070 --> 00:37:08,900
Whether we brought in a mascot or a jinx,

692
00:37:09,190 --> 00:37:10,850
we have to judge by the events.

693
00:37:11,150 --> 00:37:12,710
With all the commotion tonight—

694
00:37:12,710 --> 00:37:14,110
the chaos and uproar—

695
00:37:14,480 --> 00:37:17,540
how are we, the Xie family,
supposed to hold our heads up

696
00:37:17,670 --> 00:37:19,130
anywhere in Hengtang now?

697
00:37:23,230 --> 00:37:24,030
Mother.

698
00:37:24,320 --> 00:37:27,480
Lord Yan is, after all,
a rising star at court.

699
00:37:27,760 --> 00:37:28,710
Perhaps...

700
00:37:30,550 --> 00:37:32,510
Perhaps he simply couldn't control

701
00:37:32,510 --> 00:37:33,920
his feelings for Qingyuan

702
00:37:33,920 --> 00:37:35,480
and, out of concern for her safety,

703
00:37:35,480 --> 00:37:37,410
resorted to this absurd behavior.

704
00:37:37,550 --> 00:37:39,000
My dear Head Madam.

705
00:37:39,840 --> 00:37:42,500
You think Qingyuan
is some priceless treasure?

706
00:37:42,800 --> 00:37:44,400
To be snatched away

707
00:37:44,480 --> 00:37:46,590
by a stranger in the dead of night…

708
00:37:49,800 --> 00:37:51,190
Sorry, I misspoke.

709
00:37:52,230 --> 00:37:54,590
I mean, she was "escorted away."

710
00:37:55,320 --> 00:37:56,650
If word of this gets out,

711
00:37:57,030 --> 00:37:58,260
the whole of Hengtang

712
00:37:58,280 --> 00:37:59,880
will laugh themselves sick.

713
00:38:00,230 --> 00:38:02,710
No one will say your daughter

714
00:38:02,880 --> 00:38:05,960
is a virtuous maiden
worthy of a gentleman's courtship.

715
00:38:05,960 --> 00:38:08,070
They'll only say our Xie family

716
00:38:08,070 --> 00:38:10,630
-has raised a shameless little...
-Enough.

717
00:38:15,840 --> 00:38:16,760
Old Madam!

718
00:38:16,960 --> 00:38:17,630
Old Madam!

719
00:38:18,030 --> 00:38:19,280
A letter from Master.

720
00:38:32,750 --> 00:38:33,710
Young Master!

721
00:38:32,770 --> 00:38:35,340
[Zuixian Tavern]

722
00:38:40,190 --> 00:38:41,710
I want to go back to the tea house.

723
00:38:41,710 --> 00:38:43,590
If you go back looking like this,

724
00:38:44,070 --> 00:38:45,930
Granny Chen will be worried sick.

725
00:38:46,230 --> 00:38:47,000
Fine.

726
00:38:47,670 --> 00:38:49,870
Then I'll just stand out here all night.

727
00:38:53,150 --> 00:38:54,150
Xie Qingyuan.

728
00:38:55,000 --> 00:38:58,360
You've always prided yourself on
being able to see through people, right?

729
00:38:58,360 --> 00:38:59,840
How come you can't tell

730
00:39:02,880 --> 00:39:04,550
that I mean you no harm?

731
00:39:08,440 --> 00:39:09,800
At least, not for now.

732
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:16,670
Mother,

733
00:39:17,360 --> 00:39:19,290
what did Jingzhi say in the letter?

734
00:39:27,590 --> 00:39:28,630
A few days ago,

735
00:39:29,840 --> 00:39:31,070
I sent someone

736
00:39:31,190 --> 00:39:33,430
to deliver a letter to Shu,

737
00:39:34,230 --> 00:39:36,230
informing him of Qingyuan's return

738
00:39:37,440 --> 00:39:40,400
and Yan Rui's arrival in Hengtang.

739
00:39:41,150 --> 00:39:43,710
I asked him to look into

740
00:39:44,150 --> 00:39:45,880
Yan Rui's background thoroughly,

741
00:39:45,880 --> 00:39:46,800
so we'd know

742
00:39:47,230 --> 00:39:49,630
how best to deal with him in the future.

743
00:39:50,320 --> 00:39:52,400
This reply

744
00:39:54,030 --> 00:39:55,960
has certainly made things clear.

745
00:39:56,590 --> 00:39:57,480
Old Madam,

746
00:39:57,590 --> 00:39:58,480
so Master...

747
00:40:01,880 --> 00:40:02,960
Yan Rui

748
00:40:04,510 --> 00:40:06,510
is a close confidant of His Majesty,

749
00:40:06,840 --> 00:40:08,670
serving at His Majesty's side

750
00:40:08,760 --> 00:40:10,510
and enjoying

751
00:40:10,630 --> 00:40:12,360
His Majesty's profound favor.

752
00:40:12,480 --> 00:40:14,880
He has received countless lavish rewards,

753
00:40:14,920 --> 00:40:16,190
enjoys free access to the imperial palace,

754
00:40:16,190 --> 00:40:18,440
and travels with a large retinue.

755
00:40:19,070 --> 00:40:20,360
Everyone at court

756
00:40:20,440 --> 00:40:22,710
knows the extent of
his power and influence,

757
00:40:22,710 --> 00:40:24,400
and none dares take him lightly.

758
00:40:24,400 --> 00:40:26,320
Moreover, Yan Rui

759
00:40:26,670 --> 00:40:28,150
has amassed a considerable faction
of his own.

760
00:40:28,150 --> 00:40:30,710
Corruption runs rampant
among his associates.

761
00:40:30,710 --> 00:40:33,000
Though some officials have voiced
quiet objections,

762
00:40:33,000 --> 00:40:34,550
they fear his power too much

763
00:40:34,630 --> 00:40:36,550
to speak openly.

764
00:40:36,840 --> 00:40:38,840
Most keep silent or flatter him

765
00:40:39,000 --> 00:40:42,030
to protect themselves.

766
00:40:43,840 --> 00:40:46,960
So Jingzhi and Brother
can't do anything about it, either?

767
00:40:46,960 --> 00:40:49,440
Never mind your brother and Shu—

768
00:40:50,590 --> 00:40:53,250
even Shen Run,
His Majesty's trusted confidant

769
00:40:53,760 --> 00:40:57,000
and the Commander of the Palace Guard,

770
00:40:58,230 --> 00:41:00,550
submitted 18 memorials in succession

771
00:41:00,880 --> 00:41:02,610
and petitioned the Censorate,

772
00:41:03,000 --> 00:41:05,230
and all Yan Rui got for it

773
00:41:05,320 --> 00:41:08,450
was the cushy assignment
of overseeing disaster relief

774
00:41:08,510 --> 00:41:09,920
in Hengtang.

775
00:41:13,670 --> 00:41:14,360
Mother.

776
00:41:15,670 --> 00:41:17,360
Since our Qingyuan

777
00:41:18,360 --> 00:41:20,110
has caught Lord Yan's eye,

778
00:41:21,110 --> 00:41:22,030
why don't we

779
00:41:26,510 --> 00:41:28,240
make the best of the situation?

780
00:41:36,030 --> 00:41:37,690
I'm just worried that Yan Rui,

781
00:41:37,840 --> 00:41:39,280
who's always been reckless with women,

782
00:41:39,280 --> 00:41:41,630
only wants a fleeting affair.

783
00:41:41,630 --> 00:41:42,490
Preposterous.

784
00:41:42,880 --> 00:41:45,410
She's a daughter
of our Xie family, after all.

785
00:41:45,510 --> 00:41:47,840
How could we let him treat her
so casually?

786
00:41:58,710 --> 00:42:00,230
Prepare the red stationery.
